abstract: >-
  This codebase includes all the source code, configuration files, and intermediary scripts that were used for the submitted ISPRS Archives publication. The codebase has extensive scripts to train, test, and validate the developed hyperspectral unmixing algorithms on both lab and atmospherically simulated data.